Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `userstacktrace` option being hardcoded to use the global trace flags instead of the instance-specific trace flags. This resulted in the `userstacktrace` option for instances effectively becoming a no-operation (nop), leading to confusion for users who expected it to function correctly.

